  "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: people in Bactria Skt.: Kamboja?</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "An ancient people placed by Ptolemy in Bactria. Their precise localization is uncertain. They may be identifiable with the Kamboja, a people mentioned in Sanskrit and other Indic sources and known to have operated a trade corporation with ties to Sri Lanka.",
